# Caching for TheHighWRLD Dashboard static assets
# HTML keeps Cloudflare Pages default (max-age=0, must-revalidate) so deploys show immediately.
# JS/CSS revalidate after 1 hour (frequent deploys) + stale-while-revalidate for instant repeat loads.
# Fonts/icons are immutable (stable filenames) - cache for a year.
/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=604800
/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=604800
/*.woff2
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=3600